	"data": "University of Michigan — Computer Science & Engineering (XR Research)\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nThe University of Michigan's College of Engineering houses one of the largest and most well-resourced CS programs in the country, and its XR/spatial computing research ecosystem is both deep and expanding. The centerpiece is M.I.D.E.N. (Michigan Immersive Digital Experience Nexus) — a state-of-the-art XR facility that underwent a major upgrade…",
